data: {"id": "d992a3637a994afc-thinking-parallel_evidence-1167", "run_id": "d992a3637a994afc", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 实时状态 (kubectl get)**：Pod `workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` 状态为 `ImagePullBackOff`，`READY=0/1`，`RESTARTS=0`，已持续 57m，`phase=Pending`。未恢复。\n2. **Event 原始错误 (kubectl events)**：\n   - `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`\n   - 核心报错：`dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`\n   - 持续触发 `Back-off pulling image`（57分钟内 243 次）、`ErrImagePull`、`ImagePullBackOff`。\n3. **Pod Spec (kubectl get yaml)**：\n   - 镜像：`registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789044008550, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "d992a3637a994afc-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "d992a3637a994afc", "seq": 1168, "ts_ms": 1789044013508, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 34.882, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-02", "name": "workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/d992a3637a994afc-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "c93aa34163b2bdf448bdeccd97a4a129e45a8af28a8938b32d942f3cf804ba59", "bytes": 2451}, "snapshot_sha256": "30ff864cb2b049573d7cf903b88a8aac99c982bad4f91f960d0353e4d248e7b7"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

